    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>Morning pulses through The Gardens, vibrant and expectant. I see 12 figures filling their day. Phoenix Waterborn, a dedicated gardener, stands contemplating not far away. The sky is blanketed with clouds. The world is bitter and hushed under winter.</description>
